        },
        {
          "_key": "pt36",
          "_type": "block",
          "style": "normal",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pt35",
              "text": "That second-to-last point gets forgotten regularly and causes friction later: the two weeks you want for yourself in summer are peak season.",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": []
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": []
        },
        {
          "_key": "pt38",
          "_type": "block",
          "style": "h2",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pt37",
              "text": "Self-Managing or Outsourcing: When Each Makes Sense",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": []
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": []
        },
        {
          "_key": "pt3b",
          "_type": "block",
          "style": "normal",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pt39",
              "text": "Self-managing is realistic",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_key": "pt3a",
              "text": " if you let long-term to a single tenant, visit several times a year and have a reliable local tradesperson. That saves you 8–12% on an ongoing basis.",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": []
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": []
        },
        {
          "_key": "pt3e",
          "_type": "block",
          "style": "normal",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pt3c",
              "text": "Self-managing is effectively impossible",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_key": "pt3d",
              "text": " with short lets. The 24-hour guest reporting window, changeover cleaning and round-the-clock availability can't be run from another country.",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": []
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": []
        },
        {
          "_key": "pt3g",
          "_type": "block",
          "style": "normal",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pt3f",
              "text": "Run the arithmetic honestly: a short let carrying a 20% management fee, cleaning costs and platform commission lands much closer to a well-run long let than the gross yields suggest. The extra return is real, but it's earned income rather than passive income.",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": []
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": []
        }
      ]
    },
